# Changelog FITTSMON

Versions link to their GitHub release.

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- fittsmon-wl: rebuild the zones and re-read the config when a monitor is plugged or unplugged.

### Changed
- README: mention Wayland.

## [1.2.0] - 2026-10-12

### Added
- fittsmon-wl: Wayland build for wlroots compositors (labwc, sway, niri, Hyprland).
- `make` and `make install` build and install both fittsmon and fittsmon-wl.

### Fixed
- Remove the duplicate `[Left]` group from fittsmonrc_example.

### Removed
- fittsmon.1.in.

## [1.1.1] - 2026-10-11

### Fixed
- Pass clicks through screen corners and edges that have no command configured.
- Exit with a message when no zone has a usable command.

## [1.1.0] - 2025-04-18

### Changed
- Rename FittsTool to FittsMon.
- Force using the default monitor.
- Improve configuration handling.

### Fixed
- Several bugs related to multi-monitor support.

## FittsTool 1.0 - 2009-03-29
- Corner and edge action binding with a configuration file.

